{"id":"roc","name":{"en":"Roc","ja":"ロック鳥"},"desc":{"en":"A bird with feathers as hard as rocks. It's very aggressive, so avoid it unless you're looking for a fight.","ja":"岩のように硬い羽に覆われた鳥型モンスター。あんなに硬い羽で何故飛べるのか、実に不思議である。好戦的な性格なので、遠くからでも見かけた時は、戦闘を覚悟した方がいい。"},"race":"Bird","hp":180,"atk":36,"defen":14,"spd":45,"level":16,"locations":[{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"scorched-wasteland","name":{"en":"Scorched Wasteland","ja":"灼熱の荒野"},"parent":"arland-wastelands"},{"id":"night-s-domain","name":{"en":"Night's Domain","ja":"夜の領域"},"parent":"arland-new-world"}],"item_set":[{"id":"audra-s-tail","name":{"en":"Audra's Tail","ja":"アードラの尾羽"}}],"isDX":false,"index":11}